%% UML 2.5 state machine. Transition label syntax: trigger [guard] / effect.
%% Source: assessment/internal/service/definition/ExamDefinitionApprovalWorkflow.java
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT : / create or copy a new version
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL : submit for approval
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT : admin approves [definition valid] / wait for activation
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT : admin rejects / record rejection_reason
  DRAFT --> ACTIVE : publish, activate
  ACTIVE --> RETIRED : another version with the same code is activated
  RETIRED --> [*]
  note left of DRAFT
    Approve and reject both return to DRAFT.
    Only rejection_reason and the audit log tell them apart.
  end note
